Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.42,0:00:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then she untied me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.50,0:00:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And I told her off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.74,0:00:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But she reacted so strangely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.26,0:00:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just apologized, looking down at the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.82,0:00:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And suddenly she was a fine lady again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.56,0:00:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And I was to give her a few lashes as punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.36,0:00:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.44,0:00:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With the greatest pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.84,0:00:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Then she paid me double.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Put on her glasses, took her kid and walked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.94,0:00:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I just watched her go and thought:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.30,0:00:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor kid.
